{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>前無綫小花朱智賢近日亮相HOY TV節目《九運會客室2》，為2020年車廂偷食事件作出驚人自白。她在訪問中聲淚俱下暗示前男友疑似出軌在先，令自己失去安全感才行差踏錯。這番遲來的指控不但未能成功洗白，反而引發大批網民群起圍攻。</p>\n<h2>朱智賢爆喊揭偷食原因 暗指謝東閔行蹤飄忽</h2>\n<p>朱智賢接受由伍詠薇與李凱賢主持訪問時情緒激動，重提當年背着男友與太太臨盆在即香港先生黎振燁幽會一事。當被追問為何發生偷食蛋糕風波時，她直指與前任關係早現裂痕：「本身係Sweet嘅，跟住就⋯⋯發生咗啲事啦，自此之後所有嘢就變曬咁，因為我開始變到無咗個Trust」更爆喊暗指男方行蹤飄忽令她失去信任。她在節目中用廣憶述：「你知女人嘅第六感，有少少sense到，會留意到另一半有啲行為有啲唔同，你開始sense到有啲習慣改變咗，或者成日唔見咗人，唔得閒。」她坦言自己處理感情極差，並在鏡頭前承認當年確曾做錯事。</p>\n<h2>謝東閔不反擊舊愛指控 大方送上祝福</h2>\n<p>面對舊愛在熒幕前連番暗示控訴，謝東閔回應傳媒時表現得相當大方得體，並未有對當年事件作出任何反擊。他僅平靜地表示：「過去嘅事情，過去就讓他過去，大家往前看就好了，希望佢以後幸福快樂。」言出必行的他目前已經全面轉戰大灣區飲食界，在廣州開設時尚串燒餐廳並進入試業階段。榮升老闆後他更親自坐鎮新店，獲圈中好兄弟麥長青、金剛及關楚耀輪流現身試食撐場，現場星光熠熠氣氛熱鬧。</p>\n<h2>謝東閔當年不離不棄 陪朱智賢開記者會承擔責任</h2>\n<p>回顧這段糾纏多年的三角關係，2020年爆發車廂偷食事件後，謝東閔曾頂住極大輿論壓力，親自陪同女方出席道歉記者會面對傳媒。當時他甚至將部分責任攬上身，多年來一直默默承受外界各種冷嘲熱諷，陪伴對方度過事業與形象谷底。經歷漫長感情拉扯後，兩人才終於在前年正式宣布分手，當時男方更發文強調雙方有共識會以不同身分繼續守護對方。</p>\n<h2>舊事重提惹怒網民炮轟恩將仇報</h2>\n<p>這次深情剖白不但未獲大眾同情，反而觸發大規模網絡公關災難。大批網民留言洗版力撐男方早已仁至義盡，狠批女方如今突然重提舊事企圖轉移視線。有網民憤怒直斥：「就算感情有問題都唔係做第三者嘅藉口！」更有不少人認為當年另一男主角早已淡出幕前回歸家庭，現時再次翻舊帳，會對已退圈當事人及其妻兒造成二次傷害。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439596740869495_9315725426af44f40452dc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 （圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439596740869495_9315725426af44f40452dc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439596895046328_19047758416af44f4148fb5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 （圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439596895046328_19047758416af44f4148fb5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439596999914955_1960425356af44f42be1bd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 （圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439596999914955_1960425356af44f42be1bd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597165478448_2170603746af44f44306fb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 （圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597165478448_2170603746af44f44306fb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597294275490_14843029606af44f454c1cf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 （圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597294275490_14843029606af44f454c1cf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597395560057_13524042436af44f465f35e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 （圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597395560057_13524042436af44f465f35e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597497790890_1520262666af44f47511be.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 （圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597497790890_1520262666af44f47511be.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597568614303_12198076176af44f4822ab6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 （圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179439597568614303_12198076176af44f4822ab6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/-2024-04-29-11.52.45_326685270662f1af52cb04-1024x709.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 黎振燁與朱智賢因《食腦喪B》撻著。（圖片來源：YouTube@ TVB (official)）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/-2024-04-29-11.52.45_326685270662f1af52cb04-1024x709.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>黎振燁與朱智賢因《食腦喪B》撻著。（圖片來源：YouTube@ TVB (official)）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179429081743977306_579612256af2b481dce4c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 朱智賢坦言一早知道黎振燁已婚，原本亦認為雙方根本冇可能進一步發展，但因為男方當年一句「已經分居」，成為朱智賢心軟嘅關鍵！（圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179429081743977306_579612256af2b481dce4c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>朱智賢坦言一早知道黎振燁已婚，原本亦認為雙方根本冇可能進一步發展，但因為男方當年一句「已經分居」，成為朱智賢心軟嘅關鍵！（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/17750968901126488_185914625269cdd43a4f498.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 傳媒記招不設提問，有在場採訪資深行家都不禁表示「偷食道歉記招嚟講、呢份稿都寫得算差」！（圖片來源：東方新地）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/17750968901126488_185914625269cdd43a4f498.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>傳媒記招不設提問，有在場採訪資深行家都不禁表示「偷食道歉記招嚟講、呢份稿都寫得算差」！（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/17750968885721615_190740293969cdd438cc98b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"朱智賢 謝東閔 謝東閔表示呢段時間會多啲陪朱智賢，希望可以陪佢「走過呢個階段」。（圖片來源：TVB 娛樂新聞台 TVB Entertainment News）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/17750968885721615_190740293969cdd438cc98b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>謝東閔表示呢段時間會多啲陪朱智賢，希望可以陪佢「走過呢個階段」。（圖片來源：TVB 娛樂新聞台 TVB Entertainment News）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T11:37:16.416388+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1497,"images":12,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T11:19:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T13:32:29.271613+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T11:30:47.472190+00:00","content_hash":"ebcb27f12a0ee620f99d449657a80a926c2f5d576da65dd291c7043071e31acb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}